    {
      "sentence": "Therefore, the comment is explicit but vague, fitting score 3.",
      "error_type": "score_mapping_error",
      "explanation": "The comment meets all criteria for score 5 (explicit action with concrete details on what to implement), so the conclusion that it fits score 3 is incorrect."
    }
  ],
  "overall_basis": "The rationale's reasoning consistently supports the incorrect score of 3, with multiple material errors in applying the scoring rubric and judging the concreteness of the requested action, so it supports the wrong score."
